: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: underline;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次 Halo 来自Savage咖啡项目\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          厌氧缓慢干燥日晒 Anaerobic Slow Dried Natural\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n          风味：花香、油桃、橙子、蓝莓\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Nectarine, Orange, Blueberry\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          今年是我们第二年接触Halo批次的瑰夏日晒，与去年相比，今年的风味偏向传统日晒的花香与成熟水果的甜香，入口很轻盈上扬的花香与橙子和桃子（红色那种油桃杏桃类）的香气，酸甜很柔和，非常顺滑，中低温后开始转莓果，还有一些绿茶感，很讨人喜欢呀～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;text-decoration: underline;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次 Iridescence 来自Savage咖啡项目\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：二氧化碳浸渍水洗\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Carbonic Maceration Washed\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;font-size: 13px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.578px;'>\n          风味：花香、金桔、水果硬糖、焦糖尾韵\n         </span>\n<br/>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Floral, Kumquat, Fruit drops, Caramel finish\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          Iridensence也是第二年接触，与去年相比，今年的风味更轻盈，同样是水洗，Vivid相对来说更饱满厚重会是柑橘夹带莓果，而Iridescence则是非常细腻轻盈的柑橘调，几乎感受不到莓果，柑橘里它也是偏向于金桔，小橘子的那种风味，果酸转甜还复合着麦芽糖焦糖的那种甜感，对于我来说好像小时候吃的水果硬糖，喜欢～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;font-size: 14px;text-decoration: none;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TMPppAtBf3nsz9EF8EFCgUSpAwZxMrxZKdMkUBjuokreiaeiag8eGpD1zGkggzVDmNibgFbC2moev2g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 483px;height: 800px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Deborah\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(214, 214, 214);\">\n          下面部分文字来源于网络 https://www.gafei.com/banama/20171117112023.html\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Finca Deborah是个能源自主的庄园，其处理厂是由太阳能系统供电运作，在此高海拔偏远之地，传统电力系统无法供应处理厂所需的电力，是以庄园找到自己的方式发电。更由于此缘故，庄园得以维持该区环境的完整性与独特性。此外，做为一个荫栽种植庄园，Deborah 与该区山景融为一体，维持原有的自然环境，并维护当地鸟类与野生动物的生活区域。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RC2JF0bqwt5DuuWQXoap7nHM8DbNtfSvWibQxffgsyEib3XicjG6iaOuLEDO2Nxg9WfRc29ibATRl4UYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          黛博拉位于\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           奇里基\n          </span>\n          省的沃肯火山区，海拔1900米之上，它可能是巴拿马种植咖啡海拔zui高的地方，在这种环境下，夜间最低气温可以低至10c左右，年均降雨量2200毫米，这样的气候使得咖啡果能更缓慢的成长，积聚更多的糖分，豆子更扎实（密度更高），也因此黛博拉的咖啡品质如此之高；2016年世界咖啡师竞赛中，台湾的选手吴泽霖首次以黛博拉水洗瑰夏赢得世界冠军，2017年的世界咖啡师冲煮比赛中，前15名就有7名用得来自黛博拉的瑰夏，而取得第二名的澳洲选手用得也是黛博拉。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SyCEHetF0SicyI41Sib0QTehbybYcxE7pl8icHufDpWgEJWKlyiaN14l5KBMn98KyWvA88SaJF6YUnuQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-variant-ligatures: normal;orphans: 2;widows: 2;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;width: 584px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Savage Coffees\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;letter-spacing: 0.578px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          萨维奇咖啡，是由黛博拉、艾瑞斯庄园的拥有者Jamison Savage主导的一个咖啡项目，它的出现是为了推广性价比更高的巴拿马优质咖啡，利用在黛博拉庄园的处理经验与系统，用于周边Volcan和Boquete区域的友邻们的咖啡种植成果，而生产处理更优品质与更高商业价值的咖啡，使得参与的友邻们都可以从中得到一份更好的收益，市场上也有更多元化的产品流通。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
